1 REM FBCS PRT-0115
2 REM CLAIM A-10.5.4.1-04
3 REM TYPE SELF
100 REM MAT READ OUT OF DATA WITH IF MISSING TAKES THE ACTION (l.5960); the array keeps its size.
101 REM Whether the one datum reaches A(1) before the jump is not decided here (10.5.4.1 does not say).
110 DIM A(3)
120 MAT READ IF MISSING THEN 200: A
130 PRINT "*** TEST FAILED: NO MISSING"
140 GOTO 210
200 IF SIZE(A) = 3 THEN PRINT "*** TEST PASSED ***" ELSE PRINT "*** TEST FAILED ***"
205 DATA 1
210 END
